<h2>Questions from Carmel property owners</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>My HOA has architectural rules. Do those affect my claim?</summary><div class="a"><p>They can. Covenants may require particular materials or colors. Whether your policy pays the extra cost depends on its wording, but those requirements should be documented in the scope.</p></div></details><details><summary>Does appraisal work for high-value homes?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Appraisal is often most valuable on larger claims, where pricing differences on premium materials add up quickly.</p></div></details></div>
